Retirement: replace this local patch and exact pin only when a released Hyper
version contains the positive-budget fix and preserves exact-zero client
reads. Verify both buffer regressions and the complete/fragmented production
raw-wire cap matrix on that release, preserve the shutdown/reaping controls,
and rerun workspace build/lint/tests and all Docker build surfaces. Then
remove this vendor package, its CI test/audit entries, and context exception
together. A stock-version lockfile bump alone does not retire this repair.
